WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:03.720
Eating fruits and vegetables is&nbsp;
a part of healthy balanced diet,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:08.680
and during pregnancy its more important as&nbsp;
they provide you with many essential nutrients,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:13.080
vitamins and minerals that are necessary&nbsp;
for the normal growth, and development of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:18.120
the fetus. But some fruits and vegetables are&nbsp;
a big NO! as they can be very harmful for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:25.840
Mother and its baby. So without any furthur adue&nbsp;
lets move on, and have a look over each item.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.440
Number 1: Papaya

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:34.320
Papaya is a fruit that has the highest potential&nbsp;
of causing abortion in pregnant women, but you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:38.760
dont have to worry too much as the chemical that&nbsp;
is responsible for it is present in very least&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:45.040
amount in fresh ripe papaya fruit, but still you&nbsp;
have to be very careful and its best to avoid it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:50.720
for good. Unripe and semi ripe papaya fruit&nbsp;
have the highest quantity of papain, Thats&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:56.400
right papain is the real culprit, when consumed&nbsp;
it causes uterine contractions and bleeding which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:02.300
then leads to miscarriage and abortion. So its&nbsp;
best to avoid and stay away from this fruit.

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:02.920
ok lets move on.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.960
Number 2: Pineapples

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:13.040
Not as abortifacient as papaya but still, you&nbsp;
might have to say goodbye to this sweet-sour&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.040 --> 00:01:18.320
delight. Atleast for the first 3 months of&nbsp;
pregnancy. Now this fruit consists of bromalien,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.320 --> 00:01:24.200
which causes uterine contractions which results&nbsp;
in miscarriage or abortion. Now on this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:28.760
many researches have mixed views.&nbsp;
Some say that its good to eat and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:33.520
some advice to refrain from it.&nbsp;
But again, its best to avoid,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.520 --> 00:01:38.720
as taking precautions is much better,&nbsp;
because you never know what might happen.

00:01:38.720 --> 00:01:42.400
Number 3: Green Potatoes

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:47.280
Yes, you heard it right, now there is nothing&nbsp;
wrong with potatoes, but the green colored&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:54.400
spots on them is a poision, thats right a POISION!&nbsp;
thats not only harmful for you but also for your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.400 --> 00:02:01.840
child. Studies have shown that those green colored&nbsp;
spots are glycoalkaloid solanin. And this solanin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:06.040
has teratogenic effects on the embryo,&nbsp;
which means that when consumed in high&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.040 --> 00:02:10.520
amounts or even one toxic dose of this poision can&nbsp;
cause deformations in the embryo. Not only this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:15.160
but it also causes uterine bleeding which&nbsp;
can result in miscarriage. But you dont&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:20.800
have to worry as long as the potatoes&nbsp;
you consume are free from green spots.

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.360
So those were some dangerous&nbsp;
fruits to avoid during pregnancy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:29.840
Takecare of yourself and goodbye!

